{"id":659,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究と国際性で育む未来のリーダー","feature_description":"六年一貫の学びを通じて、社会の課題に向き合い、より良い未来を創るリーダーを育成します。科学的な探究、国際理解、読解・論述を含むリテラシー教育を組み合わせ、自ら問いを立て、批判的に考え、発信する力を伸ばします。実験、研究、海外研修、ボランティアなどの経験も重ね、多様な人と協働しながら課題を解決する力と、社会に貢献する責任感を育てます。","clubs":[{"id":12327,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12328,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12329,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12330,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12331,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12332,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12333,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12334,"name":"アメリカンフットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12335,"name":"軟式野球部（中学）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12336,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12337,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12338,"name":"ワンダーフォーゲル部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.takatsuki.ed.jp/life/extracurricular","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12339,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動